  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#800000\"><strong>储物标签</strong></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/506/566/senza-titolo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1173\" height=\"782\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790151253144895508?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mehvahdjukaar&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge&label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&\" alt=\"Support me on Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Supplementariez?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Twitter&message=Twitter&\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Youtube&message=Twitter&logoColor=ff0000\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/o39Pbe8.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>📖 简介 📖</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">储物标签 这是一个简单的模组，添加了一个物品：标签：<br></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">标签的功能类似于物品展示框，但可以适应所有表面，并且可以在物理上连接到任何实心方块，无论其形状如何。<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Shift+点击带有物品的标签，你可以更改其图像，显示你选择的该物品。&nbsp;<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">点击标签可以让玩家与后面的方块进行交互，使其成为你存储系统的完美选择。&nbsp;<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">标签显示的图像经过像素化和着色处理，以更好地融入 Minecraft 风格。这对任何物品都能无缝工作。&nbsp;<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可以接受荧光墨囊，使其在黑暗中发光。&nbsp;<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可以使用任何染料进行着色。&nbsp;<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用羽毛右键点击它们将显示物品名称。&nbsp;<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">视觉效果可以通过配置文件和材质包进行大量自定义。<br><br></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/o39Pbe8.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️支持我❤️</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">制作模组花费了我大量的时间，所以如果你喜欢我的作品并希望支持我，你可以在这里提供支持。如果你这样做，你将获得一个专属的<strong>地球仪</strong>和/或<strong>雕像</strong>！如果你使用代码 \"supplementaries\" 从 Akliz 购买服务器，这也适用。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要服务器吗？查看 Akliz，他们提供专为模组版 Minecraft 设计的高端品牌服务器。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">他们拥有温馨的玩家社区、出色的技术支持以及性能卓越的服务器</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用代码 \"supplementaries\" 可享受<strong>&nbsp;8折优惠</strong>，同时也能支持我！</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/o39Pbe8.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我们的其他模组 🦉</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"Haunted Harvest\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"Snowy Spirit\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"Storage Labels\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"Goated\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"Mysyical Oak Tree\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpeted-stairs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/658/179/638058347698730749.png\" alt=\"Carpeted Stairs\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"MmmMmmMmmMmm\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.cursefo